 "fx_note": "Moving: the kitchen's smoke, the two noren stirring, a kite over the castle, sparrows on the street; and the people's own small lives (PEOPLE-21B): O-Tane at her door, O-Kiku fidgeting, the girls writing, O-Shizu at her table, Tobei on his stool. The komuso passes along the street now and then (the design: he is in Himeji too): left to right along row 520 or so.",
